 \end{tikzpicture}}}\;=\;\delta_{abc}=\ind{a=b=c},
 \label{eq:copytensor}
\end{equation}
which hands one bit to every row that needs it. Figure~\ref{fig:countfactor} draws the factorised form, and the examples below use it.
